# Storage: use http:// — the storage server (port 60078) is plain HTTP, not TLS.
# The NSO HTTP client in SMM2 is lenient with cert validation; it tries to fetch
# thumbnails from this URL and needs the connection to succeed. HTTPS would fail since
# the server has no TLS set up.
